OL,3,ANandy and Farage field questions from
OL,4,AKuenssberg on UK-EU ties - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy tells the
OL,7,FBBC's Laura Kuenssberg a closer
OL,8,Frelationship with Europe is in the UK's
OL,9,Finterest, but admits there will have to
OL,10,Fbe "trade-offs"
OL,12,FReform UK's Nigel Farage says the
OL,13,Fgovernment's proposed youth mobility
OL,14,Fscheme - a "reciprocal" arrangement
OL,15,Fwith the EU in which young people could
OL,16,Fmove abroad for up to two years - would
OL,17,F"open the door to uncontrolled
OL,18,Fimmigration"
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
