OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, former EU chief negotiator
OL,7,FMichel Barnier tells the programme the
OL,8,FUK cannot "cherry pick" a EU single
OL,9,Fmarket deal
OL,11,FIt comes after PM Andy Burnham said he
OL,12,Fwanted to explore closer economic ties
OL,13,Fwith Europe ahead of the the UK-EU
OL,14,Fsummit later this month
